{"3168930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Infect Cam", "steam_appid": 3168930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4097970], "detailed_description": "<h1>ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/32885dfd238e84cecdc87123cf7e7d27.avif?t=1777748758\" width=1181 height=1251 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/8b714384666e1e2190a59d97bed5b1b6.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 10 years following the pandemic, humanity has fallen to millions. Billions died, but very few could stay dead...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark world, our extraction team, which conducts hostage rescue operations to save even a single person, will be pulled into the depths of darkness in search of light after stumbling upon a clue by chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/fda28fc33fadb8f1df90dc47acd0e356.poster.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/fda28fc33fadb8f1df90dc47acd0e356.webm?t=1777748758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infect Cam</strong>: A high-risk, adrenaline-filled survival experience. With your four-person team, you will constantly face enemies who outnumber you, be forced to manage limited resources, and chase a possibility that could change the fate of humanity…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/b6cc86498623cc9ec3c31ab84f2f2f83.poster.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/b6cc86498623cc9ec3c31ab84f2f2f83.webm?t=1777748758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/c10e2624ad1bff4678d5d5b3586ced71.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rescue team consists of four members. No one can survive alone, but together you have a chance. Communicate, cooperate, share resources, and trust one another to increase your chance of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/67f7b7e6468fc405a22d737e0678c403.poster.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/67f7b7e6468fc405a22d737e0678c403.webm?t=1777748758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/a601939177663405a4292704de080a79.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment matters. Just like every bullet, med-kit, and teammate. Experience the struggle for survival from a body-cam’s point of view with limited visibility. Make quick decisions while gathering equipment and supplies, because those decisions can either save your team or lead to their end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/544661340ce941b6a2be29bf27dbc53b.poster.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/544661340ce941b6a2be29bf27dbc53b.webm?t=1777748758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/44a861c2ba6244f7c76aa53d6bf7c91b.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each city will bring different challenges. Make sure to stay together. If you get lost, you’ll be alone. If you’re alone, you’ll die. As you push further into the unknown, those who don’t want you to uncover what’s hidden will come after you. Be prepared, because at the beginning of the end, you won’t be welcomed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/8b714384666e1e2190a59d97bed5b1b6.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 10 years following the pandemic, humanity has fallen to millions. Billions died, but very few could stay dead...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark world, our extraction team, which conducts hostage rescue operations to save even a single person, will be pulled into the depths of darkness in search of light after stumbling upon a clue by chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/fda28fc33fadb8f1df90dc47acd0e356.poster.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/fda28fc33fadb8f1df90dc47acd0e356.webm?t=1777748758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infect Cam</strong>: A high-risk, adrenaline-filled survival experience. With your four-person team, you will constantly face enemies who outnumber you, be forced to manage limited resources, and chase a possibility that could change the fate of humanity…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/b6cc86498623cc9ec3c31ab84f2f2f83.poster.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/b6cc86498623cc9ec3c31ab84f2f2f83.webm?t=1777748758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/c10e2624ad1bff4678d5d5b3586ced71.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each rescue team consists of four members. No one can survive alone, but together you have a chance. Communicate, cooperate, share resources, and trust one another to increase your chance of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/67f7b7e6468fc405a22d737e0678c403.poster.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/67f7b7e6468fc405a22d737e0678c403.webm?t=1777748758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/a601939177663405a4292704de080a79.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment matters. Just like every bullet, med-kit, and teammate. Experience the struggle for survival from a body-cam’s point of view with limited visibility. Make quick decisions while gathering equipment and supplies, because those decisions can either save your team or lead to their end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/544661340ce941b6a2be29bf27dbc53b.poster.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/544661340ce941b6a2be29bf27dbc53b.webm?t=1777748758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/extras/44a861c2ba6244f7c76aa53d6bf7c91b.avif?t=1777748758\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each city will bring different challenges. Make sure to stay together. If you get lost, you’ll be alone. If you’re alone, you’ll die. As you push further into the unknown, those who don’t want you to uncover what’s hidden will come after you. Be prepared, because at the beginning of the end, you won’t be welcomed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A world where the living envy the dead. Cities are plunged into darkness, the world into silence. You are part of the extraction team, but this time you are trying to save not just people, but humanity itself. Gear up, trust your comrades, and dive into the darkness to save humanity!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Russian, Turkish, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/00df61aa7ba4fb0f5b4efe93a00e55c8417046f6/header.jpg?t=1777748758", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/e5d5b18901c9e1ea0a414b385cbe191d5cb5b5e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777748758", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168930/e5d5b18901c9e1ea0a414b385cbe191d5cb5b5e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777748758", "website": "https://www.infectcam.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11500 veya AMD Ryzen 5 4500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 Super veya AMD Radeon RX 590 (8 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700K veya AMD Ryzen 7 3700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory: